<article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">⌕</div><h3>Research &amp; Case Assistance</h3><p>Structured research and case-related administrative assistance to help your team keep information clear and accessible.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact">DISCUSS YOUR NEEDS <span>→</span></a></article>
<article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">◷</div><h3>Administrative Coordination</h3><p>Reliable scheduling, follow-ups, workflow coordination, and day-to-day support that helps reduce operational friction.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact">DISCUSS YOUR NEEDS <span>→</span></a></article>
</div></div></section>
<section class="section about" id="about"><div class="container about-grid"><div class="about-visual"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505664194779-8beaceb93744?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85" alt="Law library with rows of legal books" loading="lazy"><div class="about-badge"><strong>Built around you.</strong><span>Support that respects your time, standards, and priorities.</span></div></div><div class="about-copy"><div class="eyebrow">About Northline</div><h2>Good support makes demanding work more manageable.</h2><p>Northline Legal Support is a concept for a dependable partner to legal professionals who value thoughtful service, clear communication, and careful attention to detail.</p><p>We believe support should fit the way your team works—not add another layer of complexity. Our approach is collaborative, organized, and focused on helping your practice run more smoothly.</p><ul class="check-list"><li><span>✓</span> Clear communication from start to finish</li><li><span>✓</span> Flexible support shaped around your needs</li><li><span>✓</span> A consistent, detail-focused approach</li></ul><a class="btn" href="#contact">GET TO KNOW US <span>→</span></a></div></div></section>
